Briefly - The annual certification for records disposition is due from ever=
y branch. Certify what you hold, where it is held and under which schedule =
item it falls. Where a disposition instruction is suspended, say so; a susp=
ended instruction is not the same as an expired one, and the difference mat=
ters when a matter is reopened years later. No action needed unless you see=
 an issue.